Package: mcp-server-ispconfig
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 nodejs (>= 18.17),
 hicolor-icon-theme,
Description: MCP server for the ISPConfig 3 hosting control panel
 A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that lets LLMs manage ISPConfig 3
 through its remote API: DNS, mail, websites, databases, FTP and shell
 users, cron jobs and clients, including migration between two instances.
 Writing tools can be disabled with ISPCONFIG_READ_ONLY=true.
 .
 This package vendors its production npm dependencies under
 /usr/share/mcp-server-ispconfig, as they are not available in the Debian
 archive.

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-ispconfig
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.6.0),
 mcp-server-ispconfig (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers ISPConfig 3 MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-ispconfig. Installing it registers the
 mcp-server-ispconfig binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
